OL,3,GNEWSAPort workers build school shelter
OL,4,Aand polytunnel
OL,5,
OL,6,FWorkers at the UK's busiest ferry port
OL,7,Fhave taken time out from their day jobs
OL,8,Fto plant spring bulbs for a church,
OL,9,Fbuild an outdoor shelter at a school
OL,10,Fand construct a polytunnel at a college
OL,11,Ffor horticulture training.
OL,13,FStaff carried out the activities as
OL,14,Fpart of the Port of Dover's employee
OL,15,Fvolunteering scheme, which allows them
OL,16,Fto donate one working day a year to
OL,17,Fcommunity causes.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
