OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPort workers build school shelter
OL,4,Aand polytunnel
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe scheme started in 2022 and so far
OL,7,Fthis year, volunteers have spent nearly
OL,8,F600 hours with schools and charities,
OL,9,Fwhile the port's Community Fund has
OL,10,Fraised #128,000 for local causes.
OL,12,FJulie Marson, community director, said:
OL,13,F"The Port of Dover looks after the
OL,14,Flocal community throughout the year in
OL,15,Fmany ways."
